{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"863aa7b1543849e3cfd2c559a4715af74ecbeb9dde4c86853162816b04e9f732","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1361},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["便雅憫地亞拿突城的祭司中，希勒家的兒子耶利米的話記在下面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["猶大王亞們的兒子約西亞在位十三年，耶和華的話臨到耶利米。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["從猶大王約西亞的兒子約雅敬在位的時候，直到猶大王約西亞的兒子西底家在位的末年，就是十一年五月間耶路撒冷人被擄的時候，耶和華的話也常臨到耶利米。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米蒙選召"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶利米說，耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我未將你造在腹中，我已曉得你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你未出母胎，我已分別你為聖；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已派你作列國的先知。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我就說：主耶和華啊，我不知怎樣說，因為我是年幼的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和華對我說：",{"text":"你不要說我是年幼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我差遣你到誰那裏去，你都要去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我吩咐你說甚麼話，你都要說。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要懼怕他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是耶和華伸手按我的口，對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已將當說的話傳給你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，我今日立你在列邦列國之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為要施行拔出、拆毀、毀壞、傾覆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又要建立、栽植。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["兩個異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到我說：「耶利米，你看見甚麼？」我說：「我看見一根杏樹枝。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華對我說：「你看得不錯；因為我留意保守我的話，使得成就。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["耶和華的話第二次臨到我說：「你看見甚麼？」我說：「我看見一個燒開的鍋，從北而傾。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["耶和華對我說：「必有災禍從北方發出，臨到這地的一切居民。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["耶和華說：「看哪，我要召北方列國的眾族；他們要來，各安座位在耶路撒冷的城門口，周圍攻擊城牆，又要攻擊猶大的一切城邑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["至於這民的一切惡，就是離棄我、向別神燒香、跪拜自己手所造的，我要發出我的判語，攻擊他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["所以你當束腰，起來將我所吩咐你的一切話告訴他們；不要因他們驚惶，免得我使你在他們面前驚惶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["看哪，我今日使你成為堅城、鐵柱、銅牆，與全地和猶大的君王、首領、祭司，並地上的眾民反對。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["他們要攻擊你，卻不能勝你；因為我與你同在，要拯救你。這是耶和華說的。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JER/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}